{
  "slug": "wack-100-reveals-he-has-a-verzuz-lined-up-with-game-50-cent",
  "postId": 74175,
  "title": "Wack 100 Reveals He Has A Verzuz Lined Up With Game & 50 Cent",
  "htmlContent": "<!-- wp:image {\"id\":512737,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/50-cent-the-game-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-512737\"/><figcaption>Peter Kramer, Getty Images</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Last month, 50 Cent revealed that he is no longer interested in a Verzuz Battle. Although, earlier this year, <em>Power Book III: Raising Kanan</em> executive producer said that he would only participate against The Game, “Maybe Game,” <a href=\"https://www.complex.com/music/50-cent-verzuz-not-interested\">50 said</a> when asked about a potential <em>Verzuz</em> battle. “Okay, look. He can’t play no records with my voice on ‘em.”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/julianexcalibur/status/1416067691069202435?s=20\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/julianexcalibur/status/1416067691069202435?s=20\n</div><figcaption><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“A Verzuz battle? Probably not,” 50 said. “We back outside. That was something that happened during the pandemic when we was stuck in the house. Now that we back outside, there’s other things to do. We supposed to be creating new history, not being back there.” </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After that was said, Swizz Beatz, following the Verzuz between the Lox and Dipset, was on Instagram Live with Timberland and said, \"G-Unit vs. Who? 50 Cent is scared... Let's Dance!\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\"Tell 50 Cent, don't be scared. It's a good vibe out here. He said Verzuz is doing old songs. So when you go on a show, what are you going to do to perform new songs? So 50 don't be scared we love you.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Timberland said, \"he is coming.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/LandonBuford/status/1422792625577467904?s=20\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/LandonBuford/status/1422792625577467904?s=20\n</div><figcaption><br><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On Tuesday, Game's manager Wack 100 was on Clubhouse in the Sleepless In LA room and shared that he got something lined up between both artists.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“I got it lined up 50 just been busy with the TV S***, <a href=\"https://twitter.com/LandonBuford/status/1425219604989763584?s=20\">says Wack 100</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/LandonBuford/status/1425219604989763584?s=20\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/LandonBuford/status/1425219604989763584?s=20\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Stay tuned!<gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
